      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If I recall correctly, M processor Macs are supported by EAC if it is configured properly by the devs. But Arm64 Windows 11 running within a VM on a M processor are still not supported.\n\nThat's a bummer, since I cannot quickly hop on whilst travelling unless I buy an amd64 Windows laptop.",
