      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This breaks VRChat not only for M series Macs in VMWare or Parallels, but also breaks VRChat on the slew of new ARM based laptops and PCs coming from Microsoft partners. Windows on ARM is actually becoming viable now, so EAC should be adjusted, if possible, to compensate, or replaced with something more functional.",
